{"id":"9b47287c9839ebc7","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-open-sheaf-exponential.md","title":"Theorem — 开拓扑层的指数判据","display":"Theorem — 开拓扑层的指数判据","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-open-sheaf-exponential","aliases":["14-thm-open-sheaf-exponential"],"display":"Theorem — 开拓扑层的指数判据","source_ref":"Derived from IX.4 p.486 (10), DjVu249 left, and V.2 sheaf extension definition","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-open-closed-topologies]]","[[14-thm-open-closed-closure]]","[[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]","[[14-df-j-dense-monomorphism]]","[[14-df-cartesian-closed-category]]","[[14-df-isomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-open-sheaf-exponential"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-open-sheaf-exponential</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 开拓扑层的指数判据"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"Derived from IX.4 p.486 (10), DjVu249 left, and V.2 sheaf extension definition"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"46d4e2094b01f6d4\" href=\"?note=46d4e2094b01f6d4\" title=\"14-df-open-closed-topologies\">14-df-open-closed-topologies</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b2b82e142840e429\" href=\"?note=b2b82e142840e429\" title=\"14-thm-open-closed-closure\">14-thm-open-closed-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9135c45b14ec366c\" href=\"?note=9135c45b14ec366c\" title=\"14-df-j-sheaf-object\">14-df-j-sheaf-object</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ce0c3e433ca617db\" href=\"?note=ce0c3e433ca617db\" title=\"14-df-j-dense-monomorphism\">14-df-j-dense-monomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4bf0b109a78ca196\" href=\"?note=4bf0b109a78ca196\" title=\"14-df-cartesian-closed-category\">14-df-cartesian-closed-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d5f547b903550705\" href=\"?note=d5f547b903550705\" title=\"14-df-isomorphism\">14-df-isomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"46d4e2094b01f6d4\" href=\"?note=46d4e2094b01f6d4\" title=\"14-df-open-closed-topologies\">14-df-open-closed-topologies</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E,m:U\\hookrightarrow1\">\\(\\mathcal E,m:U\\hookrightarrow1\\)</span> 与开拓扑。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda_U\">\\(\\Lambda_U\\)</span> 是指数转置，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_X:X\\times U\\to X\">\\(\\pi_X:X\\times U\\to X\\)</span> 为投影；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_X\">\\(\\delta_X\\)</span> 是以下新箭头。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\delta_X:=\\Lambda_U(\\pi_X):X\\longrightarrow X^U.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\delta_X:=\\Lambda_U(\\pi_X):X\\longrightarrow X^U.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsJSheaf}(X,j_U^{\\mathrm o},\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{IsIso}(\\delta_X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsJSheaf}(X,j_U^{\\mathrm o},\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{IsIso}(\\delta_X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>开稠密单射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:A\\hookrightarrow B\">\\(a:A\\hookrightarrow B\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_B\\Rightarrow A=\\top_B\">\\(U_B\\Rightarrow A=\\top_B\\)</span>，等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_B\\le A\">\\(U_B\\le A\\)</span>；因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\times U\\to B\">\\(B\\times U\\to B\\)</span> 经过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\times U\\to B\\times U\">\\(A\\times U\\to B\\times U\\)</span> 是同构。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 是层，所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\times U\\hookrightarrow B\">\\(B\\times U\\hookrightarrow B\\)</span> 都稠密，所以限制 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}(B,X)\\to\\operatorname{Hom}(B\\times U,X)\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}(B,X)\\to\\operatorname{Hom}(B\\times U,X)\\)</span> 为双射。指数伴随及 Yoneda 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_X\">\\(\\delta_X\\)</span> 可逆。反向，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_X\">\\(\\delta_X\\)</span> 可逆使上述限制对全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 为双射：将给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to X\">\\(A\\to X\\)</span> 限制到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\times U\\cong B\\times U\">\\(A\\times U\\cong B\\times U\\)</span>，唯一延拓到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>；再用对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的限制双射确认延拓确实等于原箭头。每个构造由指数普遍性质唯一决定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-open-closed-topologies","status":"resolved","id":"46d4e2094b01f6d4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-open-closed-topologies]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-open-closed-closure","status":"resolved","id":"b2b82e142840e429","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-open-closed-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-j-sheaf-object","status":"resolved","id":"9135c45b14ec366c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-j-dense-monomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"ce0c3e433ca617db","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-j-dense-monomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-cartesian-closed-category","status":"resolved","id":"4bf0b109a78ca196","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-cartesian-closed-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"d5f547b903550705","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-open-closed-topologies","status":"resolved","id":"46d4e2094b01f6d4","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[14-df-open-closed-topologies]] 的 $\\mathcal E,m:U\\hookrightarrow1$ 与开拓扑。$X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$。$\\Lambda_U$ 是指数转置，$\\pi_X:X\\times U\\to X$ 为投影；$\\delta_X$ 是以下新箭头。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E,m:U\\hookrightarrow1","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda_U","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_X:X\\times U\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_X:=\\Lambda_U(\\pi_X):X\\longrightarrow X^U.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsJSheaf}(X,j_U^{\\mathrm o},\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{IsIso}(\\delta_X).","display":true},{"tex":"a:A\\hookrightarrow B","display":false},{"tex":"U_B\\Rightarrow A=\\top_B","display":false},{"tex":"U_B\\le A","display":false},{"tex":"B\\times U\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A\\times U\\to B\\times U","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"B\\times U\\hookrightarrow B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}(B,X)\\to\\operatorname{Hom}(B\\times U,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_X","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"A\\times U\\cong B\\times U","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1835,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-188","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-open-sheaf-exponential|thm-242 — 开拓扑层的指数判据]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-104","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-open-sheaf-exponential]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-261","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-open-sheaf-exponential]]"},{"id":"74d933333cdc3eff","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这给出原书的开子 locale $U\\hookrightarrow X$ 和对应闭子 locale $X-U\\hookrightarrow X$ 的具体 frame，而[[14-df-open-closed-topologies]]、[[14-thm-open-closed-closure]]、[[14-thm-open-sheaf-exponential]]、[[14-thm-closed-sheaf-fiber]]、[[14-thm-open-topos-slice]]、[[14-thm-open-closed-complements]]研究的是初等拓扑斯中的 LT 拓扑、层对象与开闭子拓扑斯，类型和新增构造不同。"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-53","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-open-sheaf-exponential]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-183","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-open-sheaf-exponential]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-189","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-open-sheaf-exponential|thm-242 — 开拓扑层的指数判据]]"},{"id":"eeaa128b028a8273","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$U$ 子终意味着对角 $U\\to U\\times U$ 为同构，故 $(Y^U)^U\\cong Y^{U\\times U}\\cong Y^U$，并且此比较就是[[14-thm-open-sheaf-exponential]]的判据箭头，所以 $G_0$ 确实落在开层中。对切片对象 $p:Y\\to U$，求值给出 $Y^U\\times U\\to Y$；其逆为 $\\langle\\delta_Y,p\\rangle$，两复合利用子终性和指数求值方程验证为恒等。对开层 $X$，自然箭头 $X\\to(X\\times U)^U$ 是 $\\delta_X:X\\to X^U$ 与 $U^U\\cong1$ 的乘积，因此可逆。两组自然同构给出准逆；箭头作用保持复合由积与指数函子性。这里显式记录切片态射的源靶，避免把同一个底层箭头混用于不同切片对象对。原书 IV.7 给切片拓扑斯，IX.4 给开核；此等价是据二者完成的笔记推导。"}],"outgoing":["46d4e2094b01f6d4","b2b82e142840e429","9135c45b14ec366c","ce0c3e433ca617db","4bf0b109a78ca196","d5f547b903550705"]}